{
  "bodyHash": "bdb65dd35b14bea6",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Sharkberry Adventures</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 是一款以探索與冒險為核心的生存整合包，世界會隨著你的足跡呼吸與蛻變。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">四季輪轉覆蓋大地，搭配 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Serene Seasons</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 模組，改變農作物生長週期、晝夜長度以及各生物群系的天氣氛圍。冬季的積雪會在森林與田野堆積，讓寒冷的景觀真正呈現被厚雪掩蓋的沉重感。溫度與氣氛至關重要： </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Cold Sweat</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 會追蹤你的體溫過熱或過冷狀態，而 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Thin Air</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 則會讓高聳的山峰、深邃的洞穴與特定維度真正變得難以呼吸。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">主世界本身充滿了等待發現的事物。 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Biomes O&rsquo; Plenty</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Terralith</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Project Vibrant Journeys, This Rocks!</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 與 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Dynamic Trees</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 將地形重塑為高聳的森林、層疊的懸崖與蔥鬱的河谷，並搭配多樣的地面裝飾與下方遼闊的洞穴。來自 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Alex&rsquo;s Mobs</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Untamed Wilds</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Aquaculture 2</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Friends &amp; Foes</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 等的野生動物穿梭於這些空間中，為它們注入生動的生態氣息與新的威脅。搭配 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Ambient Environment</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Ambient Sounds</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Presence Footsteps</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 以及 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Subtle Effects</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">，即使在黃昏時分漫步於森林之中，也能讓人感覺彷彿置身於故事裡一般。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">探索的腳步也不會止步於地平線。 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">YUNG&rsquo;s</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 建築結構模組、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Dungeons Enhanced</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Structory</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Integrated Dungeons and Structures</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 等類似模組增添了廣闊的迷宮、擴充的神殿、重新設計的礦坑、更深的要塞，以及各種廢墟與巢穴。許多結構現在本身就是一場場小型冒險。通往終界的方法也透過 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">End Remastered</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 改寫。你不再需要急著尋找末影之眼，而是會收集散佈在世界各地的不同挑戰所產出的獨特末影之眼。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">當你準備離開主世界時，整合包的內容還會進一步擴展。漂浮在 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Aether</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 群島之間、穿行於 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Twilight Forest</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 的幽暗之中、深入 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Undergarden</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 的真菌洞穴，或透過 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Deeper &amp; Darker</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 踏入詭譎的異界。地獄同樣因 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Nether&rsquo;s Depths Upgrade</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 及其他增強模組煥發新生，熔岩海中充滿了奇異的生物與全新的釣魚能力。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">進度系統也進行了全面改造。鐵質及以上的武器與工具已被移除，由 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Tetra</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 取代作為你的裝備系統。你可以組裝模組化的工具與武器，在世界各地與跨維度的旅程中發現更優異的材料，並透過探索、攻略迷宮與尋找隱藏鍛造廠來解鎖全新升級。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">戰鬥體驗也因 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Better Combat</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 獲得全面翻新。 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Enhanced AI</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Zombie Awareness</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 及其他調整讓怪物能更聰明地對光線、聲音與氣味做出反應。 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Apotheosis</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 與 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Progressive Bosses</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 加入了稀有的首領怪物、更強的附魔與隨進度成長的首領戰，讓遊戲會隨著你的變強而持續反擊。此外還有 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 與 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Monster Expansion</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 等模組登場，提供極具挑戰性的戰鬥與獨一無二的獎勵。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">偏向休閒玩法方面，Sharkberry Adventures 提供了多種讓您安心定居的方式。 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">MineColonies</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 讓你能建立一座活生生的城鎮，在您的引導下逐漸發展，包含工人、衛兵、物流與防禦系統，讓您在冒險途中能體驗輕量級的殖民地模擬樂趣。對於建築愛好者來說， </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Macaw&rsquo;s</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 完整模組套件，加上 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Another Furniture</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Supplementaries</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Framed Blocks</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Rechiseled</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Chisels &amp; Bits</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 等模組，構成了龐大的方塊、家具與裝飾畫廊，讓您能從寧靜的漁村到壯闊的山脈要塞隨心建造。 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Create</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 及其擴充模組帶來精美的實作自動化系統，讓您打造磨坊、工廠、列車與各種機械裝置。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">在所有這些模組的底層，運行著一套豐富的生活品質與效能優化模組網路。 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Waystones</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 提供快速旅行功能； </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Storage Drawers</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Sophisticated Backpacks</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">、 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Iron Chests</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 與 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Lootr</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 則用於儲存物品，並在與好友遊玩伺服器時確保戰利品分配公平； </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">Corpse</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 提供陣亡後物品回收功能； </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none\">FTB Quests</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 提供任務指引（即將推出！），此外還有大量優化模組，確保整體運作流暢。</span></p>\n<p><strong>免責聲明</strong>：Sharkberry Adventures 專為現代系統設計。預設已配置 8GB RAM，這也是本整合包建議的最小記憶體需求。著色器（Shaders）預設關閉，但整合包的視覺效果部分已針對其進行優化。較舊的電腦&nbsp;<strong>將</strong>難以順暢運行此整合包。我們提供伺服器專用包（Server Pack），方便您與好友一起遊玩。</p>\n<p>本整合包不支援 Optifine，但內建了 Xenon、Oculus 及其他擴充模組，以提供類似著色器、動態光源、自發光材質等體驗。雖然整體內容已趨近完成，但本整合包仍處於積極開發階段，功能可能會隨時調整、新增或移除（以前兩項為主）。請記得經常備份您的存檔。</p>\n<p>希望您能享受本整合包提供的一切內容。若有遇到任何問題，歡迎在留言區提出 &lt;3</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>特別鳴謝：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carry-on\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carry On</a></strong> 作者：&nbsp;Tschipp 與 Purplicious_Cow</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corpse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corpse</a></strong> 作者：&nbsp;henkelmax</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-leaf-decay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Leaf Decay</a></strong> 作者：&nbsp;olafskiii</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2</a></strong> 作者：Shadow</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultris-boss-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ultris: Boss Expansion</strong></a> 作者：&nbsp;limesplatus</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetranomicon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Tetranomicon</strong></a> 作者：&nbsp;syrikalis</p>",
